AltoBaseMarket::Borrow()
├── when market is paused
│   └── it should revert
├── when market is frozen
│   └── it should revert
├── given invalid inputs
│   ├── when both assets and shares are zero or both nonzero
│   │   └── it should revert
│   ├── when receiver is zero address
│   │   └── it should revert
│   └── when sender is not authorized for onBehalf
│       └── it should revert
└── given valid inputs
    ├── when totalBorrowed assets is greater than totalSupply assets
    │   └── it should revert
    └── when totalBorrowed assets is less than or equal to totalSupply assets
        ├── when assets is zero
        │   └── it should calculate assets and opening fee from shares
        ├── when shares is zero
        │   └── it should calculate shares and opening fee from assets
        ├── when opening fee is greater than 0
        │   └── it should apply borrow opening fee
        ├── when receiver is authorized callback and data is not empty
        │   └── it should call onBorrowCallback
        ├── when receiver is authorized callback and data is empty
        │   └── it should revert
        ├── when receiver is not authorized callback and data is not empty
        │   └── it should revert
        ├── when position is not solvent after borrow
        │   └── it should revert
        ├── it should update totalBorrowed and position
        ├── it should emit Borrow event
        └── it should return assets shares openingFeeAssets